    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d259">

                <pb facs="0475" n="375" xml:id="pg375"/>

                <head>No. 258.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Davis to Mr. Morgan.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1884-08-08"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 8,
                        1884</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 629.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I herewith transmit for your files, as
                    promised, in the Department’s instruction to you, No. 609, of the 11th ultimo, a
                    copy of the note<anchor n="*" xml:id="d259-f1"/> of Mr. Romero, the minister of
                    Mexico here, of the 12th June, presenting the claim of his Government to certain
                    islands in the Rio Grande, near Roma, Tex.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>JOHN DAVIS,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Acting
                        Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
